{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"4659620","name":"东方红魔乡：新典　～ the Embodiment of Scarlet Devil.","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>※本作品仅可通过捆绑包购买。价格不变，并附带原典</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >躲避弹幕击败敌人，挑战红雾异变！<br>历经成长的开发者（自称），以全新的音乐与画面重制《东方红魔乡》。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/19588dfa332246a05c8c62d11483b053.gif?t=1788964897\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/19588dfa332246a05c8c62d11483b053.poster.avif?t=1788964897\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/d8b07d3656e06e603cb2b7658657ea9b.gif?t=1788964897\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/d8b07d3656e06e603cb2b7658657ea9b.poster.avif?t=1788964897\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/ad1b942627faece37c310008c3e79085.gif?t=1788964897\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/ad1b942627faece37c310008c3e79085.poster.avif?t=1788964897\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《东方红魔乡》是一款需要躲避华丽弹幕不断前进的纵向2D射击游戏。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >操控巫女灵梦和魔法使魔理沙，去解决席卷幻想乡的异变吧。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家需要操纵自机一边躲避密布全屏的弹幕，一边向前推进。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/2aaf9c5a8cbce6ff052acc3942ec5c3e.poster.avif?t=1788964897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/2aaf9c5a8cbce6ff052acc3942ec5c3e.webm?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/2aaf9c5a8cbce6ff052acc3942ec5c3e.mp4?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >运用玩家特有的射击方式击败对手，同时注意不要被敌人的攻击将生命值降为0。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏中有各种各样的射击类型，例如自动追踪敌人的射击，或是具有强大正面突破火力的射击。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/5460da5aafbdff43009383381d316930.poster.avif?t=1788964897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/5460da5aafbdff43009383381d316930.webm?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/5460da5aafbdff43009383381d316930.mp4?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/49229a412b0c290913f259e4fe980733.poster.avif?t=1788964897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/49229a412b0c290913f259e4fe980733.webm?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/49229a412b0c290913f259e4fe980733.mp4?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >新典为高清重置版，且所有BGM均由ZUN进行了全新编曲。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >此外，还加入了可开启无限生命进行挑战的新功能。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/96fad4c0010f37f5e4017a8a11ef29db.poster.avif?t=1788964897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/96fad4c0010f37f5e4017a8a11ef29db.webm?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/96fad4c0010f37f5e4017a8a11ef29db.mp4?t=1788964897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >操作方法</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・玩家移动：可以进行上下左右移动。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Shot：普通攻击。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Bomb：可以发动特殊攻击。种类可在选择角色时决定。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每种都有各自的特性，选择自己喜欢的来游玩吧。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >虽然攻击力非常强，但请注意有次数限制。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・低速移动：减缓玩家的移动速度，以便进行精确调整。<br>※手柄的操作按键可在游戏设置画面的按键配置中更改。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >故事背景</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >幻想乡被红色的雾气所笼罩。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >博丽神社的巫女——博丽灵梦，与</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >居住在魔法森林的魔法使——雾雨魔理沙，一同出发去解决异变。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“她”就身处那座在雾气中现身的洋馆里。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >角色介绍</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >博丽灵梦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/db1b7b3a2675cef5d64938427cc3fcfb.avif?t=1788964897\" width=150 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >博丽神社的巫女。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >凭借高超的闪避能力和宽广的攻击范围进行战斗。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >雾雨魔理沙</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/extras/57252df6671465cd8007e1c0c7aaa6b6.avif?t=1788964897\" width=180 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >居住在魔法森林的魔法使。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >以专精高火力的战斗风格挑战异变。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >同时，您还可以游玩极尽贴合2002年原版游戏的原典版。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※Classic版的游戏文字皆为日文</p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/a03579d4419322c103d139b1862ebd985659f7bc/header_schinese.jpg?t=1788964897","website":"","developers":["上海アリス幻樂団","上海アリスReprise"],"publishers":["Alliance Arts"],"release_date":"2026 年 9 月 9 日","coming_soon":false,"supported_languages":"英语, 法语, 意大利语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 俄语, 简体中文, 繁体中文, 日语, 韩语, 西班牙语 - 拉丁美洲","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","Steam 成就","可调整难度","可以仅用键盘","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","部分支持控制器","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["动作","独立"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows10 / 11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> core i5 8350U<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> UHD-Graphics-620<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 1 GB 可用空间</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/b8bb6dc1814cab38c230d03ae4f29b3af71c7765/ss_b8bb6dc1814cab38c230d03ae4f29b3af71c7765.600x338.jpg?t=1788964897","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/b8bb6dc1814cab38c230d03ae4f29b3af71c7765/ss_b8bb6dc1814cab38c230d03ae4f29b3af71c7765.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788964897"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/df81dac52d70f28c524e9227e21e9eae76fe7bed/ss_df81dac52d70f28c524e9227e21e9eae76fe7bed.600x338.jpg?t=1788964897","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659620/df81dac52d70f28c524e9227e21e9eae76fe7bed/ss_df81dac52d70f28c524e9227e21e9eae76fe7bed.192